\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 YSL Website \'97 Claude Code Build Brief\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Decision (22 Sep 2026):
\f1\b0  Custom PHP site built with Claude Code, hosted on Hostinger (Unlimited Web Hosting plan). 
\f0\b Not
\f1\b0  WordPress, 
\f0\b not
\f1\b0  Finovate/Elementor. 
\f0\b Visual approach (locked 22 Sep 2026):
\f1\b0  Recreate Finovate's 
\f0\b layout, spacing, proportions and interactions
\f1\b0 . Use YSL's 
\f0\b colours, typography and card style
\f1\b0  (from the company profile PDF), YSL's 
\f0\b content
\f1\b0 , and YSL's 
\f0\b sitemap and section structure
\f1\b0 . See \'a75. 
\f0\b Maintained by:
\f1\b0  Ayan, via Claude Code. The firm does not self-edit. 
\f0\b Companion docs:
\f1\b0  
\f2\fs26 website-structure.md
\f1\fs24  (sitemap and content decisions: still authoritative) \'b7 
\f2\fs26 layout-reference.md
\f1\fs24  (
\f0\b section-by-section layout for every page, taken from the theme's own demo data; follow it for structure
\f1\b0 ) \'b7 
\f2\fs26 theme-mapping.md
\f1\fs24  (superseded as build method; its Authorities & Forums table still applies)\
Hand this whole document to Claude Code as the project brief. Save it in the repo as 
\f2\fs26 CLAUDE.md
\f1\fs24 , and put 
\f2\fs26 layout-reference.md
\f1\fs24  and 
\f2\fs26 website-structure.md
\f1\fs24  in the repo's 
\f2\fs26 docs/
\f1\fs24  folder.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
