\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Icons:
\f1\b0  Finovate's icon font is finance/UI-only and must not be used. Use the profile PDF's practice-area icon set if the firm has source files; otherwise an open-licence set (Lucide or Tabler) as inline SVG.\

\f0\b Photography:
\f1\b0  partner headshots are cut-outs on black. Place them on 
\f2\fs26 --ink
\f1\fs24  sections only. Do 
\f0\b not
\f1\b0  reuse the Dublin/Pantheon stock images from the PDF unless licensing is confirmed, and do not use any Finovate demo image. Where Finovate has an image slot and YSL has no photo, either drop the slot or leave a neutral placeholder logged in 
\f2\fs26 CONTENT-TODO.md
\f1\fs24 .\

\f0\b Accessibility:
\f1\b0  orange on cream fails contrast for body text. Use orange only for large text, numerals, rules and accents; body text stays ink/cream. Visible focus states. Alt text on every image.\
